      "id": "claim_01f15574b46940f986f3d20800866a84",
      "statement": "The smoke-test proof dependency graph is sourced from docs/00-control/hx-proof.tsv; tools/hx-doc/hx_proof.py regenerates the per-phase tables and the Mermaid DAG in the smoke-test roadmap from that TSV and validates it (refusing blank/duplicate ids, unknown dependencies, missing authority files, unknown SUTs, bad status values, and cycles). A --check mode exits non-zero on drift, treating a missing or duplicated marker as drift in itself.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://tools/hx-doc/hx_proof.py#L1-L40",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:237286428ee26d0741dd7599d2958db93724e8b4db0c5b9c50d2f1cb507504ce:"
