      "statement": "hx_proof.py --ready <id> reports READY only when every required prior step is PASS and the step itself is neither NOT_EXECUTABLE nor already PASS (a closed proof reports ALREADY PASSED, preventing overwrite of accepted evidence). hx-smoke-promote independently re-derives the dependency set from the TSV at promotion, so the readiness check and the promotion gate enforce the same chain.",
