    {
      "id": "claim_0c365b5b98084294a6b42854f96bc067",
      "statement": "For a PASS, hx-smoke-promote requires FUNCTIONAL=PASS in result.txt, CLEANUP=PASS or NOT_APPLICABLE in cleanup.txt, recorded prior_pass_evidence and limited_integration_plan, a proof_step bound to the run's sut_host and authority in hx-proof.tsv that is not NOT_EXECUTABLE, every required prior step at PASS and cited, recorded component_version_or_revision/transport_or_endpoint/sut_ip, an unchanged authority SHA-256, and no detected secrets. Promotion never auto-commits.",
