      "statement": "BASE PASS / CLOSED requires functional known-answer PASS, cleanup PASS/NOT_APPLICABLE, cleanup verification, a separate minimum reboot-persistence proof, a server record update, and a BUILD-STATE update. Service health alone is never a functional PASS, and a functional success with failed or unverified cleanup is not a complete PASS.",
