      "statement": "For components with an assigned Web UI or product-specific MCP server the chain is parent core PASS then companion UI/MCP PASS then reboot persistence then component BASE PASS. MCP companion tests use the CentCom MCP client and do not depend on the HX-15 FastMCP server; UI companion tests use the direct LAN endpoint and do not require HX-7 NGINX unless NGINX is the SUT; a companion PASS cannot substitute for a failed parent core smoke test.",
