      "statement": "hx-smoke-doctor is the pre-session readiness probe checking the client toolset, the smoke venv, FastMCP/Playwright import, a headless Chromium launch, and (with --remote) a known-answer call to a known-good HX-2 Ollama endpoint. The same known-good probe is part of the CentCom activation gate at A5, which requires HX-5 base/domain/GPU, Ollama/Ornith PASS, HX-5 reboot persistence, CentCom toolset/bootstrap, doctor PASS, and the remote probe PASS.",
